# Torpor Orb stops a delayed triggered ability too (CR 603.2, 603.7b), and a creature token entering is a creature entering.
# Bot1 casts Rite of Harmony ("Whenever a creature or enchantment you control enters this turn, draw a card") under
# Bot2's Orb, then Stormchaser's Talent: the Class is an enchantment and no creature, so the Rite draws, and the Talent's
# own "When this Class enters, create a 1/1 Otter" triggers too. The Otter token and then Ornithopter are creatures: the
# Rite draws for neither. Hand: 7 - three Moxen and an Island = 3; turn 3 draws (4), casts the Rite (3), the Talent (2)
# and draws for it (3), then casts Ornithopter (2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
